1
00:00:00,064 --> 00:00:04,224
(Howard:)Did I tell you about the night my retainer
floated out of my mouth into the airlock?

2
00:00:04,469 --> 00:00:07,739
(Bernadette:)Yeah, you mentioned it once or twice.

3
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,630
(Howard:)So here we are.

4
00:00:10,842 --> 00:00:15,332
(Howard:)Just a couple of young newlyweds.
What to do?

5
00:00:15,546 --> 00:00:18,446
(Howard:)What to do to you?

6
00:00:22,053 --> 00:00:25,493
(Howard:)Astronaut Wolowitz reporting for booty.

7
00:00:27,692 --> 00:00:29,752
(Howard:)Preparing thrusters.

8
00:00:30,695 --> 00:00:33,065
(Howard:)We have liftoff.

9
00:00:37,335 --> 00:00:41,705
(Howard:)- Are we clear to jettison that nightgown?
- Okay, we need to talk.

10
00:00:42,407 --> 00:00:45,277
(Sheldon:)- What?
- Howie, I know you went to space...

11
00:00:45,543 --> 00:00:47,243
...and I'm incredibly proud of you.

12
00:00:47,478 --> 00:00:50,178
But you might wanna try and
not bring it up every minute.

13
00:00:50,381 --> 00:00:52,911
(Howard:)I don't talk about it every minute.

14
00:00:53,117 --> 00:00:56,027
Tonight at dinner you went on about it
for an hour straight.

